WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.600
Here’s the most common conversion.

2
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:05.800
You’ve plotted a course of zero six eight true.

3
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:10.750
The training chart area has variation of about fourteen degrees west.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.200
Going from true toward magnetic, add west: zero six eight plus fourteen is zero eight two magnetic.

5
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:23.475
Look up the deviation for that heading on the deviation card, two degrees east.

6
00:00:23.725 --> 00:00:30.725
Going from magnetic toward compass, subtract east: zero eight two minus two gives zero eight zero.

7
00:00:30.975 --> 00:00:33.000
That’s the course you steer.
